sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 👤 Client App
    participant APIGW as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant ALB as ⚖️ ALB
    participant ECS as 🐳 ECS Fargate
    participant RDS as 🗄️ PostgreSQL

    Client->>APIGW: POST /deliveryOrder
    APIGW->>ALB: Forward request
    ALB->>ECS: Forward to container
    ECS->>RDS: INSERT delivery order
    RDS-->>ECS: DB response
    ECS-->>ALB: Response (success or error)
    ALB-->>APIGW: Response
    APIGW-->>Client: HTTP Response